    "explanation": "<p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">Speed is a compound measure that shows how quickly distance changes over time. It is calculated with the formula: <strong>Speed = Distance &divide; Time</strong>. Common units are metres per second (m/s), kilometres per hour (km/h), and miles per hour (mph).</p>",
